WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.929 --> 00:00:08.129
Hey everyone. This is Jared, one of the creators
here at Wisecrack. With Halo 5 now on the shelves, we

00:00:08.129 --> 00:00:11.480
thought there’s no better time to explore
some the more interesting things happening

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.809
under the surface of this blockbuster franchise.
So without further adieu, Welcome to this

00:00:15.809 --> 00:00:19.100
episode on Identity and Religion in Halo.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.619
Who is the master Chief? With more than sixty
five million game titles sold, it’s kind

00:00:23.619 --> 00:00:28.060
of crazy that this question still remains
an enigma. But it is sort of THE reason to

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:35.079
play the game (beyond blowing up aliens and
riding around in warthogs). Master Chief is

00:00:35.079 --> 00:00:39.640
often regarded as one of the top rated video
game characters of all time—but how is that

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.930
possible if we know so little about United
Nations Space Command, Master Chief Petty

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:44.910
Officer John-117?

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:51.110
I suppose the problem starts with a much more
complicated issue: Identity itself. One’s

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:57.640
identity is never cut and dry, easily understandable.
Identity is always messy, unclear, and ambiguous.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:02.400
Not only is Master Chief’s mysterious because
we never see his face, there’s more: his

00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:06.830
name is essentially a rank and number, and
also because he isn’t really alone in all

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.369
that armor.

00:01:08.369 --> 00:01:13.049
As Master Chief’s AI, Cortana is your guide
through the Halo universe—she progresses

00:01:13.049 --> 00:01:17.880
John through the game, explains most of the
story line, and is also a sort of quasi lover

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:22.880
for the Chief.

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:27.649
It might be possible to read HALO as a feminist
text by discussing the hybrid space created

00:01:27.649 --> 00:01:33.499
by John and Cortana’s cyborg existence ala
Donna Harroway and her Cyborg Manifesto (Yes

00:01:33.499 --> 00:01:35.880
that’s a real thing go look it up…

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:38.920
but Halo 4 pretty
much shits all over that possibility when

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.590
the message essentially becomes:.
Cortana is a damsel in distress, who as a

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:47.999
woman shouldn’t think too much because…
well… that is dangerous (Literally… Cortana’s

00:01:47.999 --> 00:01:50.619
rampancy causes her to think her self… to
death).

00:01:50.619 --> 00:01:51.340
Cortana flickering in Halo 4 during Rampancy—freaking
out.

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:55.649
But I guess the important thing is that everything
is resolved because she serves her man well.

00:01:55.649 --> 00:01:59.069
Cortana’s entire story line is supposed
to be redeemed by getting to touch the chief

00:01:59.069 --> 00:02:06.179
just once. Something about men in uniform,
am I right?

00:02:06.179 --> 00:02:10.119
Perhaps identity in Halo can be best understood
through the lens of American Political Scientist

00:02:10.119 --> 00:02:15.650
and Philosopher William Connolly. He describes
identity formation as a process of becoming—where

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:20.239
a person is taught and chooses how they wish
to be through an encounter with difference.

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:25.439
Essentially—people not only define themselves
by copying what is deemed cool or acceptable,

00:02:25.439 --> 00:02:30.230
but also by distancing themselves from things
deemed unacceptable by society. It is through

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:34.930
this process of differentiating that people
form communities and self identify- whether

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:39.500
it be as a mother, son, queer, garbage man,
white, soldier, writer, gamer, etc.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:43.780
Which brings us to the essential aspect that
permeates the narrative of Halo as well as

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:48.530
the second section of this video: fear of
the unknown, or as fancy philosophers like

00:02:48.530 --> 00:02:51.020
to say: fear of “the other.”

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:57.840
It’s important to remember the historical
context surrounding Halo. Premiering in November

00:02:57.849 --> 00:03:02.760
2001, it would perhaps be naïve to assume
that game is free of the ideological politics

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:07.000
of the time. Coming directly after the 9/11
attacks—Halo mirrors several elements of

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.090
the current war on terrorism.

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:12.959
I mean, for one-the Arbiter—a disgraced
warrior- is promised forgiveness and eternal

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:15.260
salvation if he accepts a suicide mission.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:18.900
"You will die as each Arbiter has before you"

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.740
attacks or the fanaticism that
motivated the Oklahoma City bombing

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:24.099
At the heart of terrorism is fundamentalism—or
the belief that a particular creed or conviction

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:27.290
attacks or the fanaticism that
motivated the Oklahoma City bombing

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:33.300
At the heart of terrorism is fundamentalism—or
the belief that a particular creed or conviction

00:03:33.300 --> 00:03:36.740
is objectively correct—and worth dying or
killing for.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:41.360
It doesn't take too much digging to draw parallels between the Covenant and Fundamentalism.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:45.600
A highly religious people guided by the teaching
of three prophets : Truth, Mercy,

00:03:45.609 --> 00:03:50.870
and Regret, the Covenant are positioned as
the games antagonist—sort of cosmic religious

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.310
terrorists.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:56.090
Religious dogmatism is essentially the guiding
force behind the conflict in the games. The

00:03:56.090 --> 00:04:00.300
term “Covenant” itself is a reference
to a pact between a chosen people and their

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:04.680
god. The seven Halos rings are allusions to
the seven seals of the apocalypse and the

00:04:04.689 --> 00:04:07.909
seven trumpet blasts that bring about the
end of the world.

00:04:07.909 --> 00:04:12.159
The arch is a key component to activating
the Halo ring—which is in part a reference

00:04:12.159 --> 00:04:16.600
to the covenant between Noah and God, as a
way to survive the great flood.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:20.539
Knowing that the flood was an unstoppable
force—the forerunners created the arch and

00:04:20.539 --> 00:04:25.810
the halo rings as a way to survive the flood…
get it? The arch is how you survive… the

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:27.180
flood.

00:04:27.180 --> 00:04:31.539
Captain Keyes serves as a sort of John the
Baptist, Baptizing the Master Chief by giving

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:35.720
him his first gun… and also like John the
Baptist, Keyes loses his head.

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:41.940
Consider also the name we are given for the
Master Chief is John 117. John Book one verse

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:49.000
17 of the King James bible reads “For the
law was given by Moses, but Grace and Truth

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:53.759
came by Jesus Christ.” Just as Jesus gives
force to the law with his Eternal Grace, Master

00:04:53.759 --> 00:04:59.110
Chief gives force to the law with his overpowered
pistol.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:03.490
Given the multiple times that MC is resurrected
at the end of each Halo game it’s not too

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:08.690
much of a stretch to draw the comparison between
Master Chief and the big JC. Yes- It doesn’t

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:11.970
take a philosophy major to see the religious
undertones in all of this.

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:16.540
The covenant worship the forerunners—an
ancient alien race that constructed the Halo rings

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:20.900
The Covenant believe these rings were constructed for them as the chosen people.

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:25.380
or “reclaimers” of the forerunners mantel…
Only by activating the rings will their people

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:26.900
achieve eternal salvation.

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:28.940
With humanity, the covenant are confronted

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:33.380
with a race of people that make a similar
claim to ascension and access to the divine.

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:38.319
When confronted with an ideology in direct
opposition of their own there are a few options—the

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:42.120
Covenant can accept that there are multiple claims to the truth or they can exterminate

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:43.540
any threats to their faith.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:47.960
Connolly uses the term “Exclusive humanism”
to describe the belief that people have when

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:53.460
they assert that they have the god market
cornered and everyone else can literally go to hell.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:58.020
The interplanetary war in Halo starts with an attack on a human colony planet called

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:02.520
Harvest, where the Covenant attackers proclaim, "Your destruction is the will of the gods

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:04.020
and we are their instrument.”

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:08.660
Promised “The Great Journey” by the covenant
prophets—the covenant elites, brutes, jackals,

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:13.780
and other mobs fall in line and start blowing
shit up. It turns out isn’t so much salvation

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:16.650
as it is a cosmic death trap but that’s
neither here nor there.

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:21.500
When you take in to account the clearly deliberate
names “Harvest” and “The Great Journey,”

00:06:21.509 --> 00:06:26.250
all this starts to sound less like religious
fundamentalism and more like Manifest Destiny-

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:30.810
or the idea behind the “civilizing” missions
of early Colonial America.

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:35.729
“Harvest” is reminiscent of early colony
life—the harvest of crops, thanksgiving,

00:06:35.729 --> 00:06:40.710
and the pilgrims that originally came to America
are all part of the sort of story book version

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:44.490
of American settlement that we were taught
in grade school. When in reality, it was anything

00:06:44.490 --> 00:06:47.530
but a great journey or a children’s tale.

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:52.650
“The Great Journey” is salvation promised
only for the advanced. For the covenant, the

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:56.780
human race is primitive, and can’t ascend—they
aren’t promised salvation.

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:04.720
This language of primitivism versus the rational
or civilized goes all the way back to Descartes-

00:07:04.729 --> 00:07:08.360
Basically, it’s easier to subjugate and
entire population when they are reduced to

00:07:08.360 --> 00:07:11.000
a status less than human—as inferior.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:15.520
Similar to the dynamic between the humans
and the Covenant, The construction of American

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:20.270
Sovereignty—of national identity creation-
comes partly from the displacement, assimilation,

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:25.990
and eradication of the native cultures of
North America. Stripping of land rights from

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:30.550
the Natives was justified in part through
the dehumanization of their people—they

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:36.080
were uncivilized savages, primitives, brutes,
heathens—not people.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:41.110
The major event that frames Halo is the fall
of Reach—a human colony laid to waste by

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:45.889
the Covenant. By following a UNSC ship named
“the Iroquois,” the covenant are able

00:07:45.889 --> 00:07:50.830
to find Reach. Iroquois ought to sound familiar,
it's a native American nation that was part

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:54.879
of the “Seven Year’s War” or “the
French and Indian War” (to Americans).

00:07:54.879 --> 00:07:59.050
There’s some Irony here in naming a ship
intended to facilitate space colonization

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:05.129
after an indigenous nation. In fact, a kind
of strange historical reversal takes place—the

00:08:05.129 --> 00:08:10.280
UNSC, with their space marines serve as a
sort of extension of American colonialism—and

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:15.990
yet, the very same fleet positions itself
as the colonized victim of the covenant.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:21.289
If, as Connolly says, identity is constructed
through differentiating ourselves from others,

00:08:21.289 --> 00:08:26.470
then mixing imagery from religious extremism and Manifest Destiny is perhaps the peak

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:31.139
of irony for the creators. For the otherness the west fears in religious, specifically,

00:08:31.139 --> 00:08:37.000
Islamic Fundamentalism is not only embodied in the covenant but also in our very own history

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.310
of colonization.

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.400
The idea that there would be a game

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.080
where you're forced to kill innocence.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.480
Where the enemy is a blameless victim

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:47.480
probably wouldn't sell many units.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:49.480
Or maybe it would.

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:53.960
While the first person shooter genre inevitably creates shallow characters

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:56.800
to be eliminated, disintegrated, and eradicated.

00:08:56.800 --> 00:09:02.200
What Halo presents is the exploration that the enemy, the alien, the other

00:09:02.200 --> 00:09:04.200
is not so different than we pretend.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:06.760
Hey everyone, thanks for watching.

